DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260831
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] MaineCare Comprehensive Benchmarking Report I
 nitiation Notice
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			MaineCare Comprehensive Benchmarking Report Initiation 
 Notice\nMaineCare Comprehensive Benchmarking Report Initiation Notice\nAug
  31\, 2026\nThe Department initiated a comprehensive rate benchmarking rep
 ort\, as required by\nMRS Title 22 §3173-J\n.\nRate reform law requires t
 hat\, every four years\, the Department compare MaineCare rates to the rat
 es paid by the following:\nMedicare\nAt least five comparison Medicaid sta
 tes\nAny appropriate Maine commercial payers\nInterested parties will have
  the opportunity\nfor public review and commen\nt. The final report will b
 e available on the\nMaineCare Rate System Reform\nwebpage.\nFor questions 
 please contact\nMegan Scott\n\, MaineCare’s Legislative and Reform Coord
 inator.\n*This notice is provided pursuant to\nPublic Law 2022\, Chapter 6
 39\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/maineca
 re-comprehensive-benchmarking-report-initiation-notice-2026-08-31
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/mainecare-
 comprehensive-benchmarking-report-initiation-notice-2026-08-31
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
